              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-mute">tld breakdown</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-mute">{SAMPLE_NOTE}</span>
